        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"5db225ed-c3bd-4377-be13-91f05017a849\",\"review_text\":\"Very nice app\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6134694-7546-42b0-8f4a-c0c3c2164aa0\",\"review_text\":\"Lag lag lag loading loading loading. This is the slowest app on my phone fix this stuff we are paying for it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"d510ff14-ee9a-46b0-be04-7a70f12b2e35\",\"review_text\":\"I love Spotify, but the issue I'm having now is with my playlist. I put on my playlist, wanting to hear what I've put together, but the app will play 1 of playlist song & then began playing songs not connected to my playlist, this is extremely annoying. I hope this can & will be rectified soon\"},{\"review_id\":\"709b1d34-0f02-471d-a329-914f24074961\",\"review_text\":\"Not a fan of it. Design doesn't look as good as Apple's. 5 skips in the free version is just mean to be brutally honest. When I try to open an album... it doesn't open, instead it opens something wierd and I hate that. Then I try to play a song from that album... and it ends up playing a random song (which isn't even part of that album). Idk what Premium is like but free... just SUCKS! That's why I'm giving it 1 star. 😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"efc87f16-787c-4adb-9bfc-d3769dcbf418\",\"review_text\":\"Earlier version was good.... Now it has become worst than that annoying advertisement.... Deleting this for sure 👎👎👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"fadff833-9cce-4d77-a58a-7a2e06cd0896\",\"review_text\":\"Stop burning quran\"},{\"review_id\":\"d2a07de4-c74c-4312-bc42-85f1073d5da6\",\"review_text\":\"I'm Using this app Since 2021 And Enjoying well, the Songs suggestion is best, easy to make playlist, listen to songs but Now The Common problem comes of Too many Ads, Very Disappointed with this and Now If My Internet connection is Good then Sportify showing no internet connection, This App Stop showing me the lyrics either My internet is Good but shows no internet connection, the 2 start less because of ads and No internet connection problem. If you want I'll Give You the Screenshot, fix it!\"},{\"review_id\":\"fec751ae-e02a-43b1-bd56-be139c3b9f05\",\"review_text\":\"es it is nice app and phalanx dimkana\"},{\"review_id\":\"4a8f6a98-6296-49cf-baec-78dcdd1aee5f\",\"review_text\":\"It is so nise\"},{\"review_id\":\"d99a0058-081d-4967-ba00-cb9b8be548c7\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome app!\"}]}"
